# Stable spec ID: morgenthaler-bourbon-renewal. Source checked 2026-10-13. Machine generated; not human reviewed or taste-tested.

::ingredients
(bourbon) 2 oz
(lemon: juice, fresh) 1 oz
(liqueur; blackcurrant) 0.5 oz
(simple syrup) 0.5 oz
(bitters @ Angostura) 1 dash

::equipment
(cocktail shaker)
(rocks glass)

::instructions
<shake, measured ingredients with ice in (cocktail shaker)>
<strain, into a chilled (rocks glass, over fresh ice)>
[
  <garnish, with a lemon wedge>
]
-OR-
[
  <garnish, with fresh currants when in season>
]

